      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "TQMa117xL Embedded Cortex-M7 module",
      "text": "<h1>i.MX RT1170 with Real-Time Functionality</h1>\n<p>The TQMa117xL is an embedded module featuring an Arm Cortex-M7 processor based on the i.MX RT1170 series. It supports high-resolution displays up to WXGA at 60 fps and offers real-time functionality with up to 3 CAN FD interfaces. This module includes integrated security functions and is designed for energy efficiency, consuming only about 1 watt. It provides versatile communication options, including 2 Gbit Ethernet interfaces with TSN/AVB support and 2 USB 2.0 ports.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:04:43 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "altValueFromDAM": "false",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "1718154328384"
      ],
